.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><b><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>東京<rt>とうきょう</rt></ruby> &nbsp;<u>&nbsp;</u></span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">HMV&amp;BOOKS SHIBUYA</span></b></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><b><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>大阪<rt>おおさか</rt></ruby> &nbsp;<u>&nbsp;</u></span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">HMV&amp;BOOKS SHINSAIBASHI</span></b></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><b><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>福岡<rt>ふくおか</rt></ruby> &nbsp;<u>&nbsp;</u></span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">HMV&amp;BOOKS HAKATA</span></b></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">の3<ruby>店舗<rt>てんぽ</rt></ruby>ではまだ<u><ruby>折り目<rt>おりめ</rt></ruby>なしポスター</u>が<ruby>貰<rt>もら</rt></ruby>えますので、</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">GETできてない<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>は<ruby>行<rt>おこな</rt></ruby>ってみてね💨</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto