>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しみだなぁ！🫠</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><img alt=\"image0.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2023-01-20/48995_7.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><ruby>今年<rt>ことし</rt></ruby>も<ruby>色々<rt>いろいろ</rt></ruby><ruby>盛<rt>も</rt></ruby>りだくさんですが、</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">「<ruby>羅針盤<rt>らしんばん</rt></ruby>」を<ruby>宜<rt>よろ</rt></ruby>しくお<ruby>願<rt>ねが</rt></ruby>い<ruby>致<rt>いた</rt></ruby>します！🧭</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">それでは！</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">see you later✩.*˚#422</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><div>　</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: